Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the first-party source in this repository:
src/, tests/, tools/, cmake/, and the build files.

It does NOT cover, and this project does not relicense:

  * ext/ submodules, which retain their own licences. In particular ext/mame
    (MAME) is GPL-2.0-or-later and is used ONLY as a runnable, instrumentable
    reference oracle: it is built and read, never linked into src/core and
    never a dependency of any artifact this project ships. ext/musashi is
    read-only reference material for the same reason. ext/unity (MIT),
    ext/sdl (Zlib), ext/zlib (Zlib) and ext/libpng (PNG Reference Library
    licence) are linked and keep their notices.

  * Hardware manuals and vendor documentation under docs/references/, which
    remain the copyright of Apollo Computer Inc., Hewlett-Packard, Motorola
    and their successors. They are retained for reference only.

  * Apollo boot and ring-controller firmware images, and Domain/OS media,
    under roms/ and media/. These are user-supplied, gitignored, and not
    distributed by this project.
